 <span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span>\n                <span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span>\n                <span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span>\n                <span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span>\n                <span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span>\n              </div>\n<p class=\"r2-text\">Had a small issue with my order and it was sorted out the same day. That's how it should be done</p>\n<div class=\"r2-name\">Carol B.</div>\n</div>\n          </article><article class=\"r2-slide\" role=\"listitem\">\n            <div class=\"r2-card\">\n              <div class=\"r2-photo\">\n<img src=\"//wendyswaihibeach.com/cdn/shop/files/image_1783977389298_22f59bb4_1783977390280_91a1a2db.webp?v=1783977466&width=1400\" alt=\"Margaret T.\" srcset=\"//wendyswaihibeach.com/cdn/shop/files/image_1783977389298_22f59bb4_1783977390280_91a1a2db.webp?v=1783977466&width=352 352w, //wendyswaihibeach.com/cdn/shop/files/image_1783977389298_22f59bb4_1783977390280_91a1a2db.webp?v=1783977466&width=832 832w, //wendyswaihibeach.com/cdn/shop/files/image_1783977389298_22f59bb4_1783977390280_91a1a2db.webp?v=1783977466&width=1200 1200w, //wendyswaihibeach.com/cdn/shop/files/image_1783977389298_22f59bb4_1783977390280_91a1a2db.webp?v=1783977466&width=1400 1400w\" width=\"1400\" height=\"1400\" loading=\"lazy\">\n</div>\n\n              <div class=\"r2-stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\">\n                <span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span>\n                <span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span>\n                <span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span>\n                <span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span>\n                <span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span>\n              </div>\n<p class=\"r2-text\">Nothing else like it. The fabric, the fit — it all feels intentional. So sad they're closing</p>\n<div class=\"r2-name\">Margaret T.</div>\n</div>\n          </article><article class=\"r2-slide\" role=\"listitem\">\n            <div class=\"r2-card\">\n              <div class=\"r2-photo\">\n<img src=\"//wendyswaihibeach.com/cdn/shop/files/image_1783977207355_720abc4d_1783977207589_42e1b00b.webp?v=1783977466&width=1400\" alt=\"Anne W.\" srcset=\"//wendyswaihibeach.com/cdn/shop/files/image_1783977207355_720abc4d_1783977207589_42e1b00b.webp?v=1783977466&width=352 352w, //wendyswaihibeach.com/cdn/shop/files/image_1783977207355_720abc4d_1783977207589_42e1b00b.webp?v=1783977466&width=832 832w, //wendyswaihibeach.com/cdn/shop/files/image_1783977207355_720abc4d_1783977207589_42e1b00b.webp?v=1783977466&width=1200 1200w, //wendyswaihibeach.com/cdn/shop/files/image_1783977207355_720abc4d_1783977207589_42e1b00b.webp?v=1783977466&width=1400 1400w\" width=\"1400\" height=\"1400\" loading=\"lazy\">\n</div>\n\n              <div class=\"r2-stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\">\n                <span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span>\n                <span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span>\n                <span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span>\n                <span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span>\n                <span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span>\n              </div>\n<p class=\"r2-text\">Arrived faster than expected and looked even better in person. Absolutely love it</p>\n<div class=\"r2-name\">Anne W.</div>\n</div>\n          </article><article class=\"r2-slide\" role=\"listitem\">\n            <div class=\"r2-card\">\n              <div class=\"r2-photo\">\n<img src=\"//wendyswaihibeach.com/cdn/shop/files/image_1783977323522_5bc2162b_1783977323804_91aa322f.webp?v=1783977466&width=1400\" alt=\"Linda S.\" srcset=\"//wendyswaihibeach.com/cdn/shop/files/image_1783977323522_5bc2162b_1783977323804_91aa322f.webp?v=1783977466&width=352 352w, //wendyswaihibeach.com/cdn/shop/files/image_1783977323522_5bc2162b_1783977323804_91aa322f.webp?v=1783977466&width=832 832w, //wendyswaihibeach.com/cdn/shop/files/image_1783977323522_5bc2162b_1783977323804_91aa322f.webp?v=1783977466&width=1200 1200w, //wendyswaihibeach.com/cdn/shop/files/image_1783977323522_5bc2162b_1783977323804_91aa322f.webp?v=1783977466&width=1400 1400w\" width=\"1400\" height=\"1400\" loading=\"lazy\">\n</div>\n\n              <div class=\"r2-stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\">\n                <span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span>\n                <span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span>\n                <span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span>\n                <span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span>\n                <span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span>\n              </div>\n<p class=\"r2-text\">Fast shipping and the quality blew me away. You can tell every piece is chosen with care.</p>\n<div class=\"r2-name\">Linda S.</div>\n</div>\n          </article><article class=\"r2-slide\" role=\"listitem\">\n            <div class=\"r2-card\">\n              <div class=\"r2-photo\">\n<img src=\"//wendyswaihibeach.com/cdn/shop/files/image_1783977011612_3a8204de_1783977012065_c9527dd2.webp?v=1783977466&width=1400\" alt=\"Barbara K.\" srcset=\"//wendyswaihibeach.com/cdn/shop/files/image_1783977011612_3a8204de_1783977012065_c9527dd2.webp?v=1783977466&width=352 352w, //wendyswaihibeach.com/cdn/shop/files/image_1783977011612_3a8204de_1783977012065_c9527dd2.webp?v=1783977466&width=832 832w, //wendyswaihibeach.com/cdn/shop/files/image_1783977011612_3a8204de_1783977012065_c9527dd2.webp?v=1783977466&width=1200 1200w, //wendyswaihibeach.com/cdn/shop/files/image_1783977011612_3a8204de_1783977012065_c9527dd2.webp?v=1783977466&width=1400 1400w\" width=\"1400\" height=\"1400\" loading=\"lazy\">\n</div>\n\n              <div class=\"r2-stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\">\n                <span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span>\n                <span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span>\n                <span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span>\n                <span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span>\n                <span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span>\n              </div>\n<p class=\"r2-text\">Had a question about sizing and Dorothy got back to me within the hour. Incredible service</p>\n<div class=\"r2-name\">Barbara K.</div>\n</div>\n          </article><article class=\"r2-slide\" role=\"listitem\">\n            <div class=\"r2-card\">\n              <div class=\"r2-photo\">\n<img src=\"//wendyswaihibeach.com/cdn/shop/files/image_1783977125335_f35f1f52_1783977126687_47b301c2.webp?v=1783977467&width=1400\" alt=\"Margaret T.\" srcset=\"//wendyswaihibeach.com/cdn/shop/files/image_1783977125335_f35f1f52_1783977126687_47b301c2.webp?v=1783977467&width=352 352w, //wendyswaihibeach.com/cdn/shop/files/image_1783977125335_f35f1f52_1783977126687_47b301c2.webp?v=1783977467&width=832 832w, //wendyswaihibeach.com/cdn/shop/files/image_1783977125335_f35f1f52_1783977126687_47b301c2.webp?v=1783977467&width=1200 1200w, //wendyswaihibeach.com/cdn/shop/files/image_1783977125335_f35f1f52_1783977126687_47b301c2.webp?v=1783977467&width=1400 1400w\" width=\"1400\" height=\"1400\" loading=\"lazy\">\n</div>\n\n              <div class=\"r2-stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\">\n                <span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span>\n                <span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span>\n                <span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span>\n                <span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span>\n                <span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span>\n              </div>\n<p class=\"r2-text\">Ordered online and was genuinely surprised. No disappointments here — just beautiful clothing</p>\n<div class=\"r2-name\">Margaret T.</div>\n</div>\n          </article>\n</div>\n\n      <div class=\"r2-nav\" aria-label=\"Reviews navigation\">\n        <button class=\"r2-arrow r2-arrow-prev\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Previous review\">\n          <svg viewbox=\"0 0 64 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\">\n            <path d=\"M18 3 4 12l14 9M4 12h56\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\n          </svg>\n        </button>\n\n        <div class=\"r2-dots\" aria-label=\"Reviews navigation dots\">\n<button class=\"r2-dot\" type=\"button\" data-index=\"0\" aria-label=\"Go to review 1\" aria-current=\"true\"></button><button class=\"r2-dot\" type=\"button\" data-index=\"1\" aria-label=\"Go to review 2\" aria-current=\"false\"></button><button class=\"r2-dot\" type=\"button\" data-index=\"2\" aria-label=\"Go to review 3\" aria-current=\"false\"></button><button class=\"r2-dot\" type=\"button\" data-index=\"3\" aria-label=\"Go to review 4\" aria-current=\"false\"></button><button class=\"r2-dot\" type=\"button\" data-index=\"4\" aria-label=\"Go to review 5\" aria-current=\"false\"></button><button class=\"r2-dot\" type=\"button\" data-index=\"5\" aria-label=\"Go to review 6\" aria-current=\"false\"></button>\n</div>\n\n        <button class=\"r2-arrow r2-arrow-next\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Next review\">\n          <svg viewbox=\"0 0 64 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\">\n            <path d=\"M46 3l14 9-14 9M4 12h56\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\n          </svg>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n\n      <script>\n        (function() {\n          var section = document.querySelector('.reviews-2-template--28491604525382__reviews2_BrCTjE');\n          if (!section) return;\n\n          var slider = section.querySelector('#reviews-2-slider-template--28491604525382__reviews2_BrCTjE');\n          var prev = section.querySelector('.r2-arrow-prev');\n          var next = section.querySelector('.r2-arrow-next');\n          var slides = Array.prototype.slice.call(section.querySelectorAll('.r2-slide'));\n          var dots = Array.prototype.slice.call(section.querySelectorAll('.r2-dot'));\n          if (!slider || !prev || !next) return;\n\n          function getStep() {\n            var slide = slider.querySelector('.r2-slide');\n            if (!slide) return 360;\n            var gap = parseFloat(window.getComputedStyle(slider).columnGap || window.getComputedStyle(slider).gap || 0);\n            return slide.getBoundingClientRect().width + gap;\n          }\n\n          function goToSlide(index) {\n            if (!slides[index]) return;\n            slides[index].scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', inline: 'center', block: 'nearest' });\n            updateDots(index);\n          }\n\n          function updateDots(activeIndex) {\n            dots.forEach(function(dot, index) {\n              dot.setAttribute('aria-current', index === activeIndex ? 'true' : 'false');\n            });\n          }\n\n          function getClosestSlideIndex() {\n            var sliderRect = slider.getBoundingClientRect();\n            var center = sliderRect.left + (sliderRect.width / 2);\n            var closestIndex = 0;\n            var closestDistance = Infinity;\n\n            slides.forEach(function(slide, index) {\n              var rect = slide.getBoundingClientRect();\n              var slideCenter = rect.left + (rect.width / 2);\n              var distance = Math.abs(center - slideCenter);\n\n              if (distance < closestDistance) {\n                closestDistance = distance;\n                closestIndex = index;\n              }\n            });\n\n            return closestIndex;\n          }\n\n          prev.addEventListener('click', function() {\n            slider.scrollBy({ left: -getStep(), behavior: 'smooth' });\n          });\n\n          next.addEventListener('click', function() {\n            slider.scrollBy({ left: getStep(), behavior: 'smooth' });\n          });\n\n          dots.forEach(function(dot) {\n            dot.addEventListener('click', function() {\n              goToSlide(parseInt(dot.getAttribute('data-index'), 10));\n            });\n          });\n\n          var ticking = false;\n          slider.addEventListener('scroll', function() {\n            if (ticking) return;\n            ticking = true;\n\n            window.requestAnimationFrame(function() {\n              updateDots(getClosestSlideIndex());\n              ticking = false;\n            });\n          });\n        })();\n      </script>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n\n</div>"
      }
    },
    "sp_custom_html_f98QHU": {
      "type": "sp-custom-html",
      "name": "🚀SP - Custom HTML",
      "settings": {
        "title": "",
        "custom_html": "```html\n<div id=\"shopify-section-template--28491604525382__advanced_content_Xh3fzf\" class=\"shopify-section\">\n<div class=\"index-section\"><div class=\"page-width\"><div class=\"custom-content\">\n<div class=\"custom__item small--one-whole one-half align--center\">\n      <div class=\"custom__item-inner custom__item-inner--image\"><div class=\"aos-animate\"><div class=\"image-wrap loaded\" style=\"height: 0; padding-bottom: 124.13793103448275%;\">\n\n\n\n<image-element data-aos=\"image-fade-in\" data-aos-offset=\"150\" class=\"aos-init aos-animate\">\n\n\n  \n<img src=\"//wendyswaihibeach.com/cdn/shop/files/image.jpg?v=1783978272&width=1600\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"//wendyswaihibeach.com/cdn/shop/files/image.jpg?v=1783978272&width=360 360w, //wendyswaihibeach.com/cdn/shop/files/image.jpg?v=1783978272&width=540 540w, //wendyswaihibeach.com/cdn/shop/files/image.jpg?v=1783978272&width=720 720w, //wendyswaihibeach.com/cdn/shop/files/image.jpg?v=1783978272&width=900 900w, //wendyswaihibeach.com/cdn/shop/files/image.jpg?v=1783978272&width=1080 1080w, //wendyswaihibeach.com/cdn/shop/files/image.jpg?v=1783978272&width=1600 1600w\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1986.206896551724\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\" image-element\" sizes=\"(min-width: 769px) 50vw, 100vw\">\n  \n\n\n</image-element>\n</div></div></div>\n    </div>\n\n<div class=\"custom__item small--one-whole one-half align--center\">\n      <div class=\"custom__item-inner custom__item-inner--liquid\"><div class=\"rte\">\n                <style>\n@media (max-width: 600px) {\n  .farewell-text {\n    font-size: 16px !important;\n    line-height: 1.55 !important;\n  }\n}\n</style>\n\n<div style=\"max-width:720px; margin:0 auto; text-align:center; padding:10px 0;\">\n\n  <p class=\"farewell-text\" style=\"\n    font-family:'Funnel Sans', sans-serif;\n    font-size:16px;\n    line-height:1.55;\n    margin-bottom:28px;\">\n    For twenty-five years, I was a primary school teacher, and I loved every single one of them.\n\n    Every school holiday, my husband and I drove to Qualicum Beach — and the moment those beautiful shores came into view, something in me would exhale.\n  </p>\n\n  <p class=\"farewell-text\" style=\"\n    font-family:'Funnel Sans', sans-serif;\n    font-size:16px;\n    line-height:1.55;\n    margin-bottom:28px;\">\n    Eight years ago, after my last class, a small boutique came up for lease near that same beach. My husband Tom looked at me across the kitchen table and didn't say a word. He didn't have to.\n  </p>\n\n  <p class=\"farewell-text\" style=\"\n    font-family:'Funnel Sans', sans-serif;\n    font-size:16px;\n    line-height:1.55;\n    margin-bottom:28px;\">\n    I'd spent twenty-five years helping children discover confidence. Now I wanted to help women rediscover theirs. We moved, and that same year I opened the door of Wendy's Qualicum Beach for the very first time.\n  </p>\n\n  <p class=\"farewell-text\" style=\"\n    font-family:'Funnel Sans', sans-serif;\n    font-size:16px;\n    line-height:1.55;\n    margin-bottom:28px;\">\n    Now I'm sixty-four, and it's time to close this chapter. Not because something went wrong. Because something went beautifully right — and I'm wise enough to know when a story has reached its ending.\n  </p>\n\n  <p class=\"farewell-text\" style=\"\n    font-family:'Funnel Sans', sans-serif;\n    font-size:16px;\n    line-height:1.55;\n    margin-bottom:28px;\">\n    This is my favourite sale. Every piece I ever chose for this boutique was chosen with one woman in mind — the real one, not the one on the hanger. That hasn't changed.\n  </p>\n\n  <p class=\"farewell-text\" style=\"\n    font-family:'Funnel Sans', sans-serif;\n    font-size:16px;\n    line-height:1.55;\n    margin-bottom:28px;\">\n    Everything must go, at the lowest prices I've ever offered.\n  </p>\n\n  <p class=\"farewell-text\" style=\"\n    font-family:'Funnel Sans', sans-serif;\n    font-size:16px;\n    line-height:1.55;\n    margin-bottom:28px;\">\n    Find something that makes you stop. Trust that feeling. I built this place around exactly that moment.\n  </p>\n\n  <p class=\"farewell-text\" style=\"\n    font-family:'Funnel Sans', sans-serif;\n    font-size:16px;\n    line-height:1.55;\n    font-weight:700;\n    margin-top:38px;\">\n    With love,<br>\n    Wendy Anderson<br>\n    Wendy's Qualicum Beach ❤️\n  </p>\n\n</div>\n              </div></div>\n    </div>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n```"
      }
    },
    "text_and_image_GaYCVx": {
      "type": "text-and-image",
      "disabled": true,
      "name": "t:sections.text-and-image.presets.image_with_text.name",
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/image.webp",
        "image_mask": "square",
        "image2_mask": "none",
        "subtitle": "",
        "title": "",
        "text": "<p>For twenty-five years, I was a primary school teacher, and I loved every single one of them.</p><p>Every school holiday, my husband and I would drive up to Wasaga Beach — and the moment those sandy shores came into view, something in me would exhale.</p><p>Eight years ago, after my last class, a small boutique came up for lease not far from that same beach.</p><p>My husband, Tom, looked at me across the kitchen table and didn't say a word.</p><p>He didn't have to.</p><p>I'd spent twenty-five years helping children discover their confidence. Now, I wanted to help women rediscover theirs.</p><p>So we made the move.</p><p>That same year, I opened the doors of Margaret's Wasaga Beach for the very first time.</p><p>Now I'm sixty-four, and it's time to close this chapter.</p><p>Not because something went wrong.</p><p>Because something went beautifully right — and I'm wise enough to know when a story has reached its ending.</p><p>This is my favourite sale.</p><p>Every piece I've ever chosen for this boutique was chosen with one woman in mind — the real woman, not the one on the hanger.</p><p>The woman who deserves to feel beautiful.<br/>The woman who has spent years putting everyone else first.<br/>The woman who sometimes just needs to find one piece that makes her feel like herself again.</p><p>That hasn't changed.</p><p>Everything must go, at the lowest prices I've ever offered.</p><p>So come in, take your time, and find something that makes you stop.</p><p>Trust that feeling.</p><p>I built this little place around exactly that moment.</p><p>With love,</p><p>Margaret Anderson ❤️</p><p>Margaret's Wasaga Beach</p>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_style": "primary",
        "align_text": "center",
        "image_width": "66",
        "layout": "left",
        "divider": false,
        "top_padding": true,
        "bottom_padding": true,
        "lazyload_images": true
      }
    },
    "faq_PxgGRy": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "question_Vnmadh": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do you offer free shipping?",
            "text": "<p>Yes only today we offer free shipping to Canada on all orders. No hidden fees, no surprises at checkout. You'll see the full breakdown before you pay.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_6tYD4F": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How can I make sure it will fit me properly?",
            "text": "<p>Each product page includes a detailed size chart to help you find your perfect fit. We always recommend comparing the chart to a similar item you already own.</p><p>If you’re in between sizes, we generally recommend sizing up for the most comfortable fit. Still unsure? Our support team is happy to help you choose the right size!</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_bGFTkM": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How long does shipping take?",
            "text": "<p>Orders are typically processed within <strong>2 business days </strong>after being placed.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_QaTWX3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I track my orders?",
            "text": "<p>Once your order is confirmed, you will receive an email with your order number. To track your order, simply visit our order tracking page and enter your order number or email address.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_kp6n3E": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "I Have an Issue With My Order. How Can I Contact You?",
            "text": "<p>If you experience any issues or have questions, visit our contact page to connect with our support team. We’re here to assist you promptly.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
